<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram id="webpage-architecture" name="Web page architecture"><mxGraphModel dx="1500" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1500" pageHeight="1060" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="title" value="Web page of the calculator - one environment (dev or prod). Numbers refer to the legend below." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="4" width="950" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="browser" value="Browser: Flutter web page. Service URL label: https://api.&amp;lt;site&amp;gt;/api/v1 (read-only)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="230" width="190" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="gh" value="GitHub Actions (OIDC): apply auth, BFF, frontend and API hostname; build and publish the page" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="600" width="190" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="aws" value="AWS account (one per environment), us-east-2; CloudFront, WAF scope and site certificate in us-east-1" style="rounded=1;fillColor=none;html=1;fontSize=12;arcSize=4;strokeColor=#232F3E;verticalAlign=bottom;align=right;spacingRight=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="50" width="1250" height="705" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pa" value="This repository: page and login" style="rounded=1;fillColor=none;html=1;fontSize=12;arcSize=4;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=bottom;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="90" width="830" height="430" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pb" value="This repository, new: API host name" style="rounded=1;fillColor=none;html=1;fontSize=12;arcSize=4;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=bottom;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="545" width="830" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="pc" value="Other repositories (sls, ecs, later others), same account" style="rounded=1;fillColor=none;html=1;fontSize=12;arcSize=4;dashed=1;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#666666;verticalAlign=bottom;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1110" y="90" width="355" height="615" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="waf" value="WAF (prod only)" style="outlineConnect=0;dashed=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;shape=mxgraph.aws3.waf;fillColor=#759C3E;gradientColor=none;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="490" y="110" width="44" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="r53" value="Route 53" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;fillColor=#8C4FFF;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.route_53;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="110" width="50" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cf" value="CloudFront" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;fillColor=#8C4FFF;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.cloudfront;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="240" width="60" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="s3" value="S3 bucket" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#7AA116;strokeColor=none;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;pointerEvents=1;shape=mxgraph.aws4.bucket;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="700" y="170" width="48" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="bff" value="BFF Lambda: login, refresh, logout (no proxy)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fde9d9;strokeColor=#ED7100;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="300" width="170" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cog" value="Cognito" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;fillColor=#DD344C;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.cognito;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="310" width="50" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ssm" value="SSM SecureString: app client secret" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="180" width="150" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="cw" value="CloudWatch: logs and alarms" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fad7e8;strokeColor=#E7157B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="420" width="170" height="55" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sns" value="SNS (email)" style="sketch=0;outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;html=1;fontSize=12;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;fillColor=#E7157B;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.sns;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="930" y="420" width="50" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="acm1" value="ACM certificate (us-east-1) for the site" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="270" y="340" width="170" height="50" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="acm2" value="ACM certificate (regional) for the API host name" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="590" width="200" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="alr" value="4 expiry alarms (90, 60, 30, 15 days) + SNS topic" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fad7e8;strokeColor=#E7157B;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="590" width="220" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="wts" value="Weights from GitHub variables API_WEIGHT_SLS and API_WEIGHT_ECS" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="820" y="590" width="230" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sls" value="sls: API Gateway, paths /api/sls/v1 and /api/v1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#e6d0f2;strokeColor=#9333ea;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="140" width="290" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="ecs" value="ecs: load balancer, paths /api/ecs/v1 and /api/v1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#e6d0f2;strokeColor=#9333ea;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="300" width="290" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="tgt" value="SSM: target of each backend (domain name and zone ID), read here to build the weighted records" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1140" y="470" width="300" height="90" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value="1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="browser" target="cf"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value="2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=0.85;exitY=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="browser" target="r53"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="180" y="70"/><mxPoint x="1025" y="70"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value="3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=1;exitY=0.3;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cf" target="s3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="640" y="258"/><mxPoint x="640" y="195"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e4" value="4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=1;exitY=0.7;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cf" target="bff"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="640" y="282"/><mxPoint x="640" y="335"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e5" value="5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="bff" target="cog"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e6" value="6" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=0.5;exitY=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="bff" target="ssm"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="765" y="207"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e7" value="7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="bff" target="cw"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e8" value="8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="cw" target="sns"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e9" value="9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=0.25;exitY=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="browser" target="pc"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="68" y="40"/><mxPoint x="1287" y="40"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e10" value="10" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="r53" target="pc"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e11" value="11" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;labelBorderColor=#232F3E;exitX=0;exitY=0.3;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="ecs" target="cog"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1085" y="324"/><mxPoint x="1085" y="335"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Flows&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 HTTPS to the site (the shared WAF ACL filters first in prod).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;2 DNS: Route 53 answers the site name and the API host name (weighted records, one per backend).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;3 Default behavior: static page from the private bucket (origin access control).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;4 /auth/*: to the BFF function URL (origin access control, signed requests).&lt;br&gt;5 The BFF signs in, renews and revokes against Cognito as a confidential client (InitiateAuth, GetTokensFromRefreshToken, RevokeToken).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;6 It reads the client secret once at cold start.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;7 Structured logs, no secrets.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;8 Alarms on errors and throttles notify the email topic.&lt;br&gt;9 The page calls the backend directly with the bearer ID token (cross-origin, https only); the BFF is not a proxy.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;10 Weighted alias: the API host name points to sls or ecs by weight (100/0 or 0/100); the targets come from the SSM parameters each backend publishes.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;11 Backends verify the ID token against the user pool of the environment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Tokens: ID and access tokens in memory only (1 hour); refresh token in an HttpOnly cookie on /auth, fixed 24 hours. The Service URL is a read-only label derived from the page origin (api.&amp;lt;site&amp;gt;/api/v1), so the token cannot be sent to an address typed by a user; an optional build-time value overrides it. New in this change: the regional certificate for the API host name, its expiry alarms, and the weighted records; switching backends is a change of the two weight variables, not of the page. Prod only: shared WAF ACL, price class all, longer log retention, deletion protection of the user pool." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=6;strokeColor=#bbbbbb;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="250" y="775" width="1215" height="215" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
